{"tool_name":"slidetoolkit","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>SlideToolkit is a collection of command-line tools to assist with the automated histology analysis of whole-slide images. The publication linked in the \"reference\" details the actual workflow.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>This includes tools to organize the data, perform tiling and subsequent batch processing of the generated tiles in a cell profiler pipeline. All the tools are designed to run on a single PC or on a HPC system. The scripts in the toolkit are on github under MIT licence.</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>SlideToolkit is a collection of command-line tools to assist with the automated histology analysis of whole-slide images. The publication linked in the \"reference\" details the actual workflow.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This includes tools to organize the data, perform tiling and subsequent batch processing of the generated tiles in a cell profiler pipeline. All the tools are designed to run on a single PC or on a HPC system. The scripts in the toolkit are on github under MIT licence.</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2023-05-03T13:09:39+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2014-12-09T09:59:34+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":4457,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"ab9aa26e-5c3b-429d-a0b5-9bded86673f6","url":"/taxonomy/term/4457"},{"target_id":4679,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"75542251-db71-43f4-9c54-c9101ecaad78","url":"/taxonomy/term/4679"}],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1505205262,"last_comment_uid":164,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Bastiaan G. L. Nelissen "},{"value":"Joost A. van Herwaarden"},{"value":"Frans L. Moll"},{"value":"Paul J. van Diest"},{"value":"Gerard Pasterkamp"}],"has_biological_terms"